<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9808" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conchȳlĭum</span></b> , ii,
			n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κογχύλιον</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A shell-fish, a testaceous animal</i>, in gen.,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				9, 29, 46, § 86</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Div.
				2, 14, 33</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Specif. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>An oyster</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Pis.
				27, 67</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. Epod. 2, 49</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. S. 2,
				2, 74</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 4, 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 8, 27</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Cels.
				2, 18</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A kind of purple shell-fish</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color conchyli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 1074</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cat. 64, 49</span></i> Sillig <i>N.
				cr.;</i>
			<i><span class="en">Col. 8,
				17, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 7,
			13</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b>
			<i>Purple color, purple</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 26, § 59</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 36, 60, § 127
			sq.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>Purple garments, purple</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 2,
				6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 3, 81</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 101 al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
